+## 12. Exact limitations and evidence
+
+This audit neither installed nor executed an IPA/DEB. It did not rebuild, change
+behavior, modify protected branches, merge, push, or perform live third-party API
+tests. It did not establish a reproducible source-to-binary proof, independently
+review all Google/DRM/FFmpeg/JS code, decode DER entitlements, verify signing chains,
+measure actual data collection, or enumerate runtime-generated/obfuscated endpoints.
+The local native Sponsor test was skipped; historical CI is identified as historical.
+Pattern/import/string absence and archive equality cannot establish absence of
+malicious logic, memory corruption, host-mediated calls or encrypted secrets.
